          ],
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "훈련 기록이 며칠째 제자리걸음이다."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Training results have been stuck for days."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "417b7aea-df0d-5115-88b7-5179a53135f0"
        },
        "417b7aea-df0d-5115-88b7-5179a53135f0": {
          "localId": 3,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "감독님… 요즘 아무리 훈련해도 늘지가 않아요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Coach... no matter how much I train, I'm not getting better."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "894dd4ed-9e31-56d0-b93f-b64c99eb7c07"
        },
        "894dd4ed-9e31-56d0-b93f-b64c99eb7c07": {
          "localId": 4,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "벽에 막힌 느낌이에요. 뭘 붙잡고 넘어서야 할지 모르겠어요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "It feels like I hit a wall. I don't know what to hold on to, to get past it."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "7f67b16e-3ba9-51ce-ab4b-2ad3eeda897a"
        },
        "7f67b16e-3ba9-51ce-ab4b-2ad3eeda897a": {
          "localId": 5,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "연습만으로는 이제 한계야. 실전에서 넘어 보자. 목표를 하나 정하지."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Practice alone won't do it now. Let's break through in real matches. Pick a goal."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "f64847d4-2a47-52ca-ae67-d3dff81db480"
        },
        "f64847d4-2a47-52ca-ae67-d3dff81db480": {
          "localId": 6,
          "type": "Select",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "39e38b72-5d60-5b2f-a38a-31bb9d5a643f",
              "text": "(목표 고르기 — 게임이 목표 셋으로 바꾼다)",
              "next": "8bc06cf8-b0d0-537c-ad59-52c6b60aa276",
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "(Goal pick — the game replaces it with three goals)"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "8bc06cf8-b0d0-537c-ad59-52c6b60aa276": {
          "localId": 7,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "알겠습니다. 꼭 해내 볼게요!"
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Got it. I'll make it happen!"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "44eaf647-9d87-5270-88cd-ef04ab1cdbf4"
        },
